# Build context for `docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile .` (repository root).
#
# Everything here stays OUT of the image: history, the machine's own build output,
# the local demo environment (which holds a generated secret), the rehearsal tree,
# tests and evidence documents, and the PROPOSED migrations — those are not part of
# the shipped schema and must never be baked into an image.
.git
.gitignore
.next
node_modules
.demo
.deploy
coverage
tests
docs
bridge
prisma/proposed-migrations
*.md
.env*
*.log
